<http://digistrucmed.org/DoseEntity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-type/CONDITION_OR_FINDING> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/EntityType> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_d1710bde778e9e1be7f11ed2fef05ae0e7ef558d8677a37c27ae7f454230f712_n0040/tu_0001> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Quinidine\nIncreases sinus node frequency and prolongs PR interval, QRS duration, and QT interval\na\n(VF\nc\n, BrS, SQTS)\n600–1600 mg\nLoading dose:\nStart 200 mg every 3 h until effect, max. 3 g in first 24 h\nCardiac:\nHypotension, TdP\nd\nExtracardiac:\nGastrointestinal disturbances, auditory and visual disturbances, confusion, leukopenia, haemolytic anaemia, thrombocytopenia, anaphylaxis\nContraindications:\nSevere sinus node dysfunction, severe AV or intraventricular conduction disturbances, previous MI, significant SHD, hypotension, LQTS" .
